  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EFFECTS Plus in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EFFECTS Plus project, led by GC in partnership with Kivulini and the Government of Tanzania, aims to adapt and expand the original EFFECTS  intervention to prevent violence against women, girls, and children. Building on the 2018&#x2013;2023 trial in Mara, which improved child nutrition, development, and women&#x2019;s empowerment while reducing intimate partner violence, this project will advance evidence on effective, gender-transformative strategies in Tanzania. The initiative strengthens parenting and nutrition practices by engaging both mothers and fathers in promoting healthier, safer environments for children.&#x200b;</narrative>
  </description>
